<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP, Ergo drop NZ one-yr fixed rate to 8.95 pct.</title>
<headline>AMP, Ergo drop NZ one-yr fixed rate to 8.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial institution Australian Mutual Provident Society (AMP) and its New Zealand telephone banking arm Ergo said on Tuesday they would drop their New Zealand one-year fixed mortgage rate to 8.95 percent from 9.25 percent effective April 23.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
